# Custom recipe for iw 6.9 (makefile)
#
# `iw` is the modern nl80211 wireless configuration CLI.  It is the tool users
# reach for to inspect/adjust a WiFi interface when GoboNet (the Gobo-native
# wpa_supplicant+dhcpcd manager) is not enough: `iw dev`, `iw list`,
# `iw <if> scan`, `iw <if> link`, regulatory-domain handling, ...
#
# iw is self-contained except for libnl: it builds its own nl80211.c but links
# libnl-genl-3 for the generic-netlink transport (the base ISO already ships
# LibNL 3.x with the libnl-3/libnl-genl-3 pkg-config files, so no extra recipe
# is needed).
#
# Installs /System/Index/bin/iw -> Programs/IW/6.9/sbin/iw.  GoboNet's backend
# shells out to /bin/iwlist (Wireless-Tools) for scanning, so iw is purely an
# operator convenience here.

